  <p id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001:m0000" ref="6y2_apj_l05">順帝</persName><persName id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABAAA">謝皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001:m0006" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABAAA">梵境</persName>，陳郡陽夏人，右光祿大夫<persName id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001:m0020" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABA">莊</persName>孫女也。昇明二年，立為皇后。<persName id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001:m0035" ref="6y2_apj_l05">順帝</persName>禪位，降為汝陰王妃。<persName id="c-songshu-041-xiefanjing:p001:m0047" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABA">莊</persName>自有傳。</p>
</text>
